Skills: SDD Ecosystem

Purpose:
  SDDRA ecosystem-specific skills for integration, event processing,
  field mapping, notification dispatch, scheduled sync, and gamification.
  Gamification skills are derived from CaptainUp industry best practices
  and encode patterns for player profiles, rule engines, leaderboards,
  points economy, and anti-cheat systems.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
    1  @INDEX.sdd
    2  @SKILL-INTEGRATION-MODULE.sdd
    3  @SKILL-EVENT-PROCESSOR.sdd
    4  @SKILL-FIELD-MAPPING.sdd
    5  @SKILL-NOTIFICATION.sdd
    6  @SKILL-SCHEDULED-SYNC.sdd
    7  @SKILL-GAMIFICATION-RULES.sdd
    8  @SKILL-PLAYER-PROFILE.sdd
    9  @SKILL-LEADERBOARD.sdd

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn SDD ecosystem patterns
  APPLY    — apply patterns to new integrations
  REVIEW   — review implementation against skills
  UPGRADE  — propose skill improvements

Rules:
  [S1] Integration modules MUST have explicit boundaries.
  [S2] Event processors MUST implement claim/handle/complete lifecycle.
  [S3] Field mapping MUST be config-driven, not hardcoded.
  [S4] Notifications MUST support multi-channel dispatch with daily limits.
  [S5] Scheduled sync MUST be idempotent and observable.
  [S6] Gamification rules MUST be declarative, async, and non-blocking.
  [S7] Player profiles MUST use immutable external IDs and async sync.
  [S8] Leaderboards MUST separate write and read models with caching.
  [S9] Point awards MUST be idempotent and fully auditable.
  [S10] Anti-cheat MUST be async, non-blocking, and support rollback.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    SKILL-INTEGRATION-MODULE.sdd
    SKILL-GAMIFICATION-RULES.sdd

  Resolve:
    integration-module
    event-processor
    field-mapping
    notification
    scheduled-sync
    gamification-rules
    player-profile
    leaderboard

Navigation:
  IntegrationModule: @SKILL-INTEGRATION-MODULE.sdd
  EventProcessor: @SKILL-EVENT-PROCESSOR.sdd
  FieldMapping: @SKILL-FIELD-MAPPING.sdd
  Notification: @SKILL-NOTIFICATION.sdd
  ScheduledSync: @SKILL-SCHEDULED-SYNC.sdd
  GamificationRules: @SKILL-GAMIFICATION-RULES.sdd
  PlayerProfile: @SKILL-PLAYER-PROFILE.sdd
  Leaderboard: @SKILL-LEADERBOARD.sdd

State: +
